@ 10.3.5.4 - Proto-New Caledonia to Proto-Northern
# citation: thetha, from Ozanne-Rivierre, Françoise (1992), “The Proto-Oceanic Consonantal System and the Languages of New Caledonia”. Oceanic Linguistics 31(2):191 – 207; and Ozanne-Rivierre, Françoise (1995), “Structural Changes in the Languages of Northern New Caledonia”. Oceanic Linguistics 34(1):44 – 72
	q qː k kː s sː > k kː c cː t̪ t̪ː
	Cː > Cʰ
